		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d4+DEX Bludgeoning</p><p><strong>Properties:</strong> Light, Thrown 4</p><hr><p><em>Improviser (Tools of the Deadeye): anything small enough (and dangerous enough) that you can hold becomes a thrown weapon. You always seem to have at least 2×LVL “things” within reach to throw.</em></p><hr><p><em>[A] Granted by Improviser. Its Thrown range shows +4 with Master Thrower (Thrown 8). In the attack dialog the <strong>Thrown attack?</strong> box starts ticked for it.</em></p><p><em>[M] It takes no inventory slot and never runs out — describe what you throw (a brick, a bottle, a chair leg…).</em></p>",
